164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Data storytelling is about presenting data in a way that makes it compelling and easy to understand. Instead of just listing numbers, I try to frame insights as a story. For example, rather than saying "sales dropped by 10%," I would say, "Sales fell by 10% due to increased competition and reduced advertising, but increasing promotions could help recover the loss." Storytelling helps engage stakeholders and ensures data-driven decisions are made effectively.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
