180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I follow established data protection regulations such as GDPR and CCPA to ensure ethical data collection and privacy. This includes obtaining consent from users for data collection, anonymizing personal information, and implementing strict access controls. I also work to minimize any risks associated with data misuse by ensuring that only authorized personnel have access to sensitive data. In a recent project, I collaborated with the legal team to ensure that customer data was anonymized for analysis, adhering to GDPR guidelines.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
