212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In healthcare, big data is used to track disease outbreaks by analyzing patient data in real time, enabling healthcare providers to respond quickly. For example, by analyzing hospital data, predictive models can identify areas at risk for disease spread. In retail, big data is used to personalize recommendations based on customer behavior analysis. For instance, I helped a retail company implement a big data solution that analyzed customer purchase history, which enabled them to recommend products tailored to individual preferences, ultimately increasing sales.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
