/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Key challenges in working with big data include processing speed, storage requirements, ensuring data quality, and managing unstructured data. The sheer volume of data requires significant computing resources, and dealing with unstructured data \(like text, images, or social media posts\) presents difficulties in extraction and analysis. In a past project, I worked with a team to build a data pipeline for processing large volumes of customer feedback, which required overcoming challenges related to storing and analyzing both structured and unstructured data.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
