/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I have used SQL for structured data analysis and worked extensively with Python \(specifically libraries like Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn\) for data manipulation and machine learning. For handling big data, I have experience with Hadoop, Spark, and NoSQL databases like MongoDB. For data visualization, I rely on tools like Tableau and Power BI to communicate insights effectively. In a previous project, I used Spark to process and analyze large amounts of transactional data in real time, which helped optimize inventory management for a retail chain.)
